  ],
  "decision": "Parquet60.1.0 pinned with default-features=false and zstd only, no Arrow runtime. Use four required INT64 columns, explicit UTC-millis/unsigned-sequence logical annotations, ZSTD3/plain/no dictionary and bounded row groups. Metadata/footer and data-page sizes must be preflighted before upstream allocation. Existing RSFZ stays pinned to zstd0.13.3; Parquet adds zstd0.14.4 with shared zstd-sys C package. Codec comparison and dependency/binary cost must be measured; no automatic production selection.",
  "unsafe_native_boundary": "Application remains safe Rust. Parquet/zerocopy/hash implementations and shared ZSTD C form third-party boundaries; selected review is not a vulnerability or formal memory-safety audit."
}
